	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "u-blox NEO LCC-24, 12.2 x 16.0 x 2.4 mm (NEO-M8T), castellated. Land per u-blox NEO-8Q/NEO-M8 hardware integration manual UBX-15029985 sec. 2.3: 0.8 x 1.8 mm pads on a 1.1 mm pitch, 1.0 mm under the module and 0.8 mm outside it, 3.0 mm gap between pins 7-8 and 17-18. Paste: the full pad per SOLDER-PASTE-CONVENTION section 2, carried 0.4 mm further out to the 14.6 mm span of the manual's paste mask so the half-vias wet on a thin foil. Courtyard allows for the 0.5 mm de-paneling tab the data sheet (UBX-15025193 table 15) says can sit on either short end.")
